Naino Ki To Baat guitar chords with strumming pattern also known as Tu Mera Hai Sanam Guitar Chords sang by Altaf Sayyed from Album Hum Deewane Hain Aapke (Mera Sanam).

Strumming Pattern: D UDD D D

[Bbm]Naino ki to baat

[F#]naina jaane [G#]hai

[G#]Sapno ke raaj to

Raina jaane [Bbm]hai

